# SPOT in TEXT mode at the exit pupil of the far-field Cassegrain, Tout frame (cmdref: Outputs)
# the obscured chief ray must not abort the spot (CLAUDE.md "SPOT BEAM reference frame: obscured chief ray");
# the spot file is written beside the deck, so the deck is a COPY in the scratch directory
# COPY: $RES/pymacos/tests/Rx/Rx_Cass_FarField.in
old $DECK
text
spot 6 tout
/null
spot 6 beam
/null
# EXPECT: Plot type set to TEXT
# EXPECT: Chief ray location: x=
# EXPECT: Centroid of spot diagram
# EXPECT: Writing Spot Diagram, Elt=6
# EXPECT-NOT: chief ray becomes undefined
# EXPECT-NOT: forrtl
